{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "09", "m": "09", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "06", "M": "56", "S": "14"}}, "news": [{"title": "Kolkata: KMC decided to shut down 919 lodges, guest houses, assures of fast-track reopening after fire compliance", "para": "The Kolkata Municipal Corporation is set to reopen over 900 previously closed lodges and guest houses. To ensure public safety, owners are required to upgrade their fire safety measures and comply with building codes. This decision follows a tragic fire incident at a crowded lodge on Free School Street.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/hospitality/kolkata-kmc-decided-to-shut-down-919-lodges-guest-houses-assures-of-fast-track-reopening-after-fire-compliance/133953032?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-232138/133953032.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "hospitality"}, {"title": "Ranchi civic body's survey finds 1,300 hostels, lodges operating without licence", "para": "A recent survey highlighted that close to 1,300 hostels in Ranchi are operating without valid municipal licenses. This troubling discovery follows a tragic hostel collapse in Delhi, which claimed the lives of seven individuals. Many students are more focused on low costs and availability, neglecting the necessity for safety. Unlicensed hostels will face immediate scrutiny, with notices being issued regarding their building plans, requiring proper documents for future operations.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/hospitality/ranchi-civic-bodys-survey-finds-1300-hostels-lodges-operating-without-licence/133952957?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-31002/133952957.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "hospitality"}, {"title": "Rentomojo raises \u20b9376 crore from anchor investors ahead of IPO", "para": "Rentomojo has successfully raised \u20b9376.07 crore from anchor investors ahead of its initial public offering. The firm issued over 9.3 million equity shares to 41 investors at a price of \u20b9404 each. The IPO is set to open for subscription from September 9 to September 11, 2026, with a price range established between \u20b9384 and \u20b9404 per share.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/allied-industries/rentomojo-raises-376-crore-from-anchor-investors-ahead-of-ipo/133953412?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-117872/133953412.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "allied-industries"}]}